OL,3,GNEWSACharity 'terrified' closure could
OL,4,Aleave mums suicidal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity has said it is "terrified"
OL,7,Fnew mums suffering from suicidal
OL,8,Fthoughts will be left with nowhere to
OL,9,Fturn if its group sessions end due to
OL,10,Ffunding pressures.
OL,12,FThe Happy Mums Foundation, which
OL,13,Fsupports women experiencing postpartum
OL,14,Fmental health challenges, was set up in
OL,15,F2015 and has helped more than 1,000
OL,16,Ffamilies across Cumbria.
OL,18,FCharity director Lucinda Bray fears the
OL,19,Floss of the in-person "safe place"
OL,20,Fcould worsen the mental health of
OL,21,Fvulnerable women in the county.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
